            {
              "startFrame": 14,
              "endFrame": 176,
              "text": "3 条评价，能定义一个人吗？\nThree reviews cannot define a person."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 192,
              "endFrame": 384,
              "text": "样本越小，结论越跳。\nSmall samples swing hard."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 402,
              "endFrame": 594,
              "text": "样本越大，均值越稳。\nBigger samples stay steadier."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 606,
              "endFrame": 714,
              "text": "三个点，也能连成一条线。\nThree dots make one trend line."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 726,
              "endFrame": 834,
              "text": "但线，是人画上去的。\nBut the line is drawn by hand."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 852,
              "endFrame": 932,
              "text": "第一次的极端，第二次多半靠近平均。\nExtremes tend to drift back."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 936,
              "endFrame": 1044,
              "text": "不是退步，是回归。\nNot decline — regression."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 1062,
              "endFrame": 1188,
              "text": "盲人摸象：局部是真的，整体不是。\nEach part true but not whole."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 1194,
              "endFrame": 1284,
              "text": "全象不等于三块局部。\nThe whole is not three parts."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 1302,
              "endFrame": 1410,
              "text": "从 3 到 1000，标准误约小 18 倍。\nError shrinks eighteenfold."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 1416,
              "endFrame": 1524,
              "text": "误差减半，样本要翻四倍。\nHalf the error needs four times the sample."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 1542,
              "endFrame": 1650,
              "text": "样本越小，故事越大。\nSmall sample tells a big story."
            },
            {
              "startFrame": 1656,
              "endFrame": 1734,
              "text": "先把样本做大，再下结论。\nGrow the sample then conclude."
            }
          ]
        }
